    {
      "type": "tweet",
      "id": "1996630646199071087",
      "url": "https://x.com/DDNewslive/status/1996630646199071087",
      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/DDNewslive/status/1996630646199071087",
      "text": "🚨TRAFFIC ADVISORY🚨\n\nOn 05.12.2025, due to administrative exigencies, traffic restrictions & diversions will be in place in both the carriageways and service roads around W Point, A Point ITO Chowk, BSZ Marg, Delhi Gate, JLN Marg, Rajghat Crossing, Shanti Van Crossing, Hanuman Setu- Y Point, Netaji Subhash Marg, Nishad Raj Marg, Saleem Garh Flyover By Pass, MGM- Pragati Maidan Tunnel to Hanuman Setu, Kashmere Gate, Vikash Marg and IP Marg. \n\nCommuters are advised to avoid these routes from 09:00 AM to 12:00 noon and use alternative roads for a hassle-free journey. Parking will only be allowed in designated areas.\n\nNo vehicles will be allowed to be parked on Bahadur Shah Zafar Marg, JLN Marg and Ring Road from Hanuman Setu-Shanti Van to Rajghat to I.P. Flyover to Pragati Maidan Tunnel, Nishad Raj Marg, IP Marg (both the carriageways) on 05.12.2025. \n\nVehicles parked on these roads will be towed away and prosecuted as per law.\n\n#Delhi #DelhiNCR",
